{"title":"Snakeskin Knick","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Small Copperhead, Coral Snake, Copperhead, Large Copperhead, Rustscale</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"small-copperhead\" title=\"Small Copperhead - Normal, 42.9% of recorded drops (3 / 7 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/79167631ab2fcb600a3d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Small Copperhead</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">42.9%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"coral-snake-medium\" title=\"Coral Snake - Normal, 22.2% of recorded drops (2 / 9 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d37b212af105279dd66e.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Coral Snake</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">22.2%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"copperhead-medium\" title=\"Copperhead - Normal, 33.3% of recorded drops (2 / 6 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/b3d9f1ef60e7bcc1b106.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Copperhead</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">33.3%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"copperhead-large\" title=\"Large Copperhead - Normal, 20.0% of recorded drops (1 / 5 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7150a841a248719b713b.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Large Copperhead</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">20.0%</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"rustscale\" title=\"Rustscale - Normal, 14.3% of recorded drops (1 / 7 events)\"><img class=\"thumb mo